# SPA fallback. Every route (/journal/pressurestat, /services, …) is rendered
# by React Router in the browser, so the server must return index.html instead
# of a 404 for any path it cannot find on disk. Without this, links work while
# clicking around but a direct visit or a refresh 404s.
#
# Read by Netlify and Cloudflare Pages. Vercel uses vercel.json instead.
